"/tools\">Game development</a><a href=\"/game-assets\">Assets</a><a href=\"/comics\">Comics</a><div class=\"divider\"></div><a href=\"/sales\">Sales</a><a href=\"/bundles\">Bundles</a><div class=\"divider\"></div><a href=\"/jobs\">Jobs</a><div class=\"divider\"></div><a href=\"/tags\">Tags</a><a href=\"/game-development/engines\">Game Engines</a></div></div><div id=\"wrapper\" class=\"jam_page_wrap\"><div id=\"view_jam_4268323\" class=\"view_jam_page view_jam_base_page page_widget base_widget view_jam_default before_start has_banner\"><div class=\"jam_banner_outer\"><img src=\"https://img.itch.zone/aW1nLzMwNDYwMTU4LnBuZw==/original/N1e8Oi.png\" class=\"jam_banner \"/></div><div class=\"jam_body\"><div id=\"jam_header_6915214\" class=\"jam_header_widget base_widget\"><div class=\"header_inner\"><div class=\"header_columns\"><div class=\"title_colum\"><h1 class=\"jam_title_header\"><a href=\"/jam/trijam-393\">Trijam #393: The 3 hour game jam</a></h1><div class=\"jam_host_header\">Hosted by <a href=\"https://trijam.itch.io\">Trijam</a>, <a href=\"https://kriskuroni.itch.io\">KrisKuroni</a>, <a href=\"https://nerdpoint.itch.io\">nerdPoint</a> · <a href=\"https://bsky.app/hashtag/trijam\">#trijam</a></div></div><div class=\"stats_container\"><div class=\"stat_box\"><div class=\"stat_value\">74</div><div class=\"stat_label\">Joined</div></div></div></div><div class=\"header_tabs\"><a data-label=\"tab_view_jam\" href=\"/jam/trijam-393\" class=\"header_tab active\">Overview</a><div class=\"tab_group\"><a href=\"/jam/trijam-393/community\" class=\"header_tab\">Community</a><span class=\"community_activity\">3</span></div></div></div></div><div class=\"submitter_outer\"><div id=\"jam_submitter_9967944\" class=\"jam_submitter_widget base_widget before_start\"><div class=\"date_data\">Submissions open from <span class=\"date_format\" data-format=\"MMMM Do YYYY [at] h:mm A\">2026-10-09 09:00:00</span> to <span class=\"date_format\" data-format=\"MMMM Do YYYY [at] h:mm A\">2026-10-12 09:00:00</span></div><div class=\"countdown\"><span class=\"countdown_label\">Starts in</span><div class=\"times\"><div data-name=\"years\" class=\"time_block\"><div class=\"block_value\"></div><div class=\"block_label\">years</div></div><div data-name=\"months\" class=\"time_block\"><div class=\"block_value\"></div><div class=\"block_label\">months</div></div><div data-name=\"days\" class=\"time_block\"><div class=\"block_value\"></div><div class=\"block_label\">days</div></div><div data-name=\"hours\" class=\"time_block\"><div class=\"block_value\"></div><div class=\"block_label\">hours</div></div><div data-name=\"minutes\" class=\"time_block\"><div class=\"block_value\"></div><div class=\"block_label\">minutes</div></div><div data-name=\"seconds\" class=\"time_block\"><div class=\"block_value\"></div><div class=\"block_label\">seconds</div></div></div></div><div class=\"state_action\"><button data-method=\"post\" data-href=\"/jam/420634/join\" class=\"button fat submitter_button join_jam_btn\">Join jam</button></div></div></div><div class=\"jam_content user_formatted\"><iframe frameborder=\"0\" scrolling=\"no\" style=\"width:100%; min-height:650px\" src=\"https://trijam.rocknightstudios.com/poll/jam/393\"></iframe>\r\n<p><img src=\"https://img.itch.zone/aW1nLzU1MDYyNDQuZ2lm/original/LnWp4%2F.gif\" loading=\"lazy\"><br></p>\r\n<p>\r\n</p>\r\n<figure><img src=\"https://img.itch.zone/aW1nLzI1NDE0OTk3LnBuZw==/original/JkPpVL.png\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure>\r\n<p>Trijam is a weekly game jam where your goal is to make something playable (and fun!) in just 3 hours, and our history shows that it’s more than just possible! Here’s a short video explaining how it works if you don’t feel like reading the page.\r\n</p>\r\n<h1><div class=\"text-center\"><iframe width=\"560\" height=\"315\" src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/DsNdWe0gljA?si=AjEex5b5n97hYl11\" frameborder=\"0\" allowfullscreen=\"\"></iframe></div></h1>\r\n<p class=\"text-center\"><br></p>\r\n<figure><img src=\"https://img.itch.zone/aW1nLzI1NDE0OTgzLnBuZw==/original/n1%2B%2Bit.png\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure>\r\n<figure><img src=\"https://img.itch.zone/aW1nLzI1NDE0OTg5LnBuZw==/original/AKeZUd.png\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure>\r\n<p>The rules are simple: try your best to make the game in 3 hours, <strong>but even if you can’t</strong> - still submit it, you are allowed to go overtime! However, <strong>only games developed in 3 hours or under are eligible to get the 1st place</strong>.&nbsp;The time only counts for building your game, that is, any coding, making sound effects/music, art, and other assets. Writing a design doc, coming up with ideas, compiling your game, or making the itch.io page for it does not!\r\n</p>\r\n<p>You can use the official unofficial Trijam timer/study music video to time your 3 hours! Pause when you take a break, continue when you come back!</p>\r\n<h1><div class=\"text-center\"><iframe allowfullscreen=\"\" frameborder=\"0\" src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/tdF8wJsxjz4?si=cJPqRElP_P4bVt3o\" height=\"315\" width=\"560\"></iframe></div></h1>\r\n<p>You can split your time into however many chunks you want, too - work on it for 3 hours straight, or for one hour each session, or any other way you may prefer!<br></p>\r\n<p>Have a team? Great! Everyone on your team gets their own 3 hours! One person may focus on one part, another on another, and so on. There are no restrictions on team sizes, so invite your friends!\r\n</p>\r\n<p>Using pre-made assets is no problem, just make sure that you have the necessary rights to use them, and attribute them in your game’s description properly.</p>\r\n<p>\r\n</p>\r\n<p><strong><em>Also, if possible, prefer web/HTML5 builds of your games so more people can play them!\r\n</em></strong></p>\r\n<h2><img src=\"https://img.itch.zone/aW1nLzI1NDE0OTkzLnBuZw==/original/7qECJZ.png\" loading=\"lazy\"></h2>\r\n<p>Every week, the community (that’s you!) votes on the theme for the jam out of 5 themes we arbitrarily choose. We sometimes take theme suggestions too! Join our Discord (see below) to take part in that. You are free to interpret every theme in any way.\r\n</p>\r\n<p>The theme gets announced every Friday, along with the next jam’s page on our Discord.\r\n</p>\r\n<p>The jam takes place every weekend from Friday 9 AM UTC - Monday 10 AM UTC, so there is plenty of time for you to take part!\r\n</p>\r\n<p>After the jam is over, the voting period starts and ends on Wednesday 7 PM UTC.\r\n</p>\r\n<p>The games are rated in a 5 star system in the following categories</p>\r\n<p class=\"text-center\">\r\n</p>\r\n<p class=\"text-center\"><img src=\"https://img.itch.zone/aW1nLzI1NDE0OTg2LnBuZw==/original/3%2BwdZy.png\" loading=\"lazy\"></p>\r\n<p></p>\r\n<p>You can vote however you like, as long as your votes are consistent across all games. Whether 4/5 for graphics means “it’s nice” or “it’s not that nice” to you, make sure to apply that to all games equally! Thanks!<br></p>\r\n<h1><img src=\"https://img.itch.zone/aW1nLzI1NDE0OTg3LnBuZw==/original/1f8hEY.png\" loading=\"lazy\"></h1>\r\n<p>Every week after the jam has ended, we have two streamers who will play your games and give feedback. They are:\r\n</p>\r\n<p><a href=\"https://www.twitch.tv/kriskuroni\" referrerpolicy=\"origin\" rel=\"nofollow noopener\">KrisKuroni</a> (Twitch) I will livestream your games on Tuesday and Wednesday. I will need web/HTML5 build of your games, but I will play windows versions if the developers request it on stream.\r\n</p>\r\n<p><a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCWsdrDTss6Tq52qzz_2rGYw\" referrerpolicy=\"origin\" rel=\"nofollow noopener\">Paanch Tanmatra Studio</a> (YouTube) will livestream your games. They can also play Windows games. <br></p>\r\n<p>Use hashtag #Trijam on Twitter during the jam and we&#x27;d love to check out your games and retweet @TrijamGJ.<br></p>\r\n<p>To get notifications on these livestreams, join our Discord where you can chat with fellow jammers!\r\n</p>\r\n<p><strong></strong></p>\r\n<p><iframe src=\"https://discordapp.com/widget?id=807355689482977290&theme=dark\" width=\"550\" height=\"420\" frameborder=\"0\"><span></span>&lt;/span&gt;</iframe></p>\r\n<p><strong></strong></p>\r\n<h3>Here’s a history of previous winners!\r\n</h3>\r\n<p>&nbsp;\r\n<iframe src=\"https://trijam.rocknightstudios.com/hof/10\" style=\"width:100%; min-height:1200px\" frameborder=\"0\"><span></span></iframe>\r\n</p>\r\n<div class=\"text-center\"><strong><iframe style=\"width: 500px; height: 281px\" src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/FZbJck8wKKw\" allowfullscreen=\"\" frameborder=\"0\"></iframe> \r\n</strong><p><br></p>\r\n</div></div></div><script id=\"add_game_to_jam_lightbox_tpl\" type=\"text/template\"><div tabIndex=\"-1\" role=\"dialog\" id=\"add_game_to_jam_lightbox_8549187\" class=\"add_game_to_jam_lightbox_widget lightbox_widget base_widget  force_login has_fields lightbox\"><button class=\"close_button\"><svg height=\"18\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" aria-hidden class=\"svgicon icon_cross2\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" width=\"18\" version=\"1.1\" stroke-width=\"2\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" role=\"img\"><line x1=\"18\" y1=\"6\" x2=\"6\" y2=\"18\"></line><line x1=\"6\" y1=\"6\" x2=\"18\" y2=\"18\"></line></svg></button><h2>Log in to continue</h2><p>This jam is using <a target=\"_blank\" href=\"http://itch.io\">itch.io</a> to host entries. You&#039;ll need to register or log in on\n      itch.io in order to <span class=\"on_submit\">submit your game</span><span class=\"on_join\">join this jam</span>.</p><p class=\"on_submit\">After signing in you can create a new game on itch.io then\n      return here and click the <em>submit game</em> button again to enter your game.</p><p><a href=\"/login?return_to=https%3A%2F%2Fitch.io%2Fjam%2Ftrijam-393&amp;intent=jam_submit\" data-register_action=\"jam_submit\" class=\"button\">Log in</a><span class=\"or_split\"> or </span><a href=\"/register?return_to=https%3A%2F%2Fitch.io%2Fjam%2Ftrijam-393&amp;intent=jam_submit\" data-register_action=\"jam_submit\" class=\"button\">Register</a></p></div></script></div></div><script id=\"loading_lightbox_tpl\" type=\"text/template\"><div aria-live=\"polite\" class=\"lightbox loading_lightbox\"><div class=\"loader_outer\"><div class=\"loader_label\">Loading</div><div class=\"loader_bar\"><div class=\"loader_bar_slider\"></div></div></div></div></script><script type=\"text/javascript\">new I.ViewJam('#view_jam_4268323', {\"end_date\":\"2026-10-12 09:00:00\",\"start_date\":\"2026-10-09 09:00:00\",\"id\":420634,\"voting_end_date\":\"2026-10-14 18:00:00\"});init_JamLayoutHeader('#jam_layout_header_7450601', {\"autocomplete_props\":{\"autocomplete_url\":\"\\/autocomplete\",\"search_url\":\"\\/search\",\"i18n\":{\"search_placeholder\":\"Search for games, jams, tags or creators\",\"search\":\"Search\"},\"ca_types\":{\"jam\":4,\"featured_tag\":7,\"browse_facet\":8,\"game\":1,\"bundle\":6},\"ca_source\":25}});\nI.setup_page();</script></body></html>"}